{"id":"0f7cd94927463198","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hierarchy-closure.md","title":"算术层级的闭包与包含","display":"thm-hierarchy-closure — 算术层级的闭包与包含","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hierarchy-closure","aliases":["20-thm-hierarchy-closure"],"display":"thm-hierarchy-closure — 算术层级的闭包与包含","chapter":"4","section":"4.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.1.4","source_pdf_pages":[116,117],"source_printed_pages":[80,81],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hierarchy-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hierarchy-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hierarchy-closure — 算术层级的闭包与包含"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.1.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>116</span><span>117</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>80</span><span>81</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma^0_{n,k},\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma^0_{n,k},\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in\\Gamma\">\\(R,S\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR\\cup S,R\\cap S\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\cup\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\subseteq\\Delta^0_{n+1,k},\\\\\nR\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\Longleftrightarrow\\omega^k\\setminus R\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR\\cup S,R\\cap S\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\cup\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\subseteq\\Delta^0_{n+1,k},\\\\\nR\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\Longleftrightarrow\\omega^k\\setminus R\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补集等价由存在／全称对偶及可计算矩阵的布尔否定得到。两个同类前束式先把绑定变量换为互不相交的名字；在并、交公式中按交替量词块同步排列，两个同型量词用配对编码成一个量词，矩阵取布尔并或交。因此量词交替次数不增。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_n\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_n\\)</span>，在末端补一个无作用量词得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}\">\\(\\Sigma_{n+1}\\)</span> 形式，在前端补一个无作用全称量词得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}\">\\(\\Pi_{n+1}\\)</span> 形式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 情形对偶，所以各自都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{n+1}\">\\(\\Delta_{n+1}\\)</span>。空关系、全关系由常值可计算矩阵给出。相同的量词变换也适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算基底，因为有限布尔运算与配对不会改变 oracle。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.1.4(i)–(iii)；印刷 80–81 / PDF 116–117。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma^0_{n,k},\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R,S\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR\\cup S,R\\cap S\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\cup\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\subseteq\\Delta^0_{n+1,k},\\\\\nR\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\Longleftrightarrow\\omega^k\\setminus R\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1692,"backlinks":[{"id":"d6bcd07303c88c81","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-thm-1gen-low]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]；see [[20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"7e4e35763e70ecc9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]。"},{"id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-complement]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]；see [[20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。"}],"outgoing":["832f53dc90c8947a"]}